WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:02.580
Your health record is private.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:06.425
It holds your name, your medicines, and your test results.

3
00:00:07.285 --> 00:00:10.405
AI helpers can now read records like this.

4
00:00:10.485 --> 00:00:13.255
They can answer your questions, and even act for you.

5
00:00:13.335 --> 00:00:16.275
That is useful. It is also risky.

6
00:00:17.095 --> 00:00:21.355
HealthClaw is a guard that sits between the AI and your record.

7
00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:24.275
It keeps your record apart from everyone else's.

8
00:00:24.355 --> 00:00:26.450
And it makes three promises.

9
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:31.960
Promise one. The AI gets your health facts, not your contact details.

10
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.990
Your name shrinks to initials.

11
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.875
Your phone number and address are taken out.

12
00:00:37.695 --> 00:00:40.455
Promise two. Every look is written down.

13
00:00:40.535 --> 00:00:43.575
If the note can't be written, the look doesn't happen.

14
00:00:44.395 --> 00:00:49.605
Promise three. The AI can't send a form, a call, or a text on its own.

15
00:00:49.685 --> 00:00:51.345
It can only suggest one.

16
00:00:51.425 --> 00:00:54.075
Nothing is sent until you tap Approve.

17
00:00:56.085 --> 00:01:00.445
Automatic tests check these promises every time the code changes.

18
00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:05.400
Here, a patient asks about their blood tests, and gets a plain answer.

19
00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:08.900
Everything you saw used made-up records.

20
00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:12.510
In our app, real records are invite-only for now.

21
00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:15.900
And no doctor has signed off on the medical parts yet.

22
00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:20.660
HealthClaw 2.0 is free, and anyone can read its code.

23
00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.650
See how it works at healthclaw.io.

24
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:26.375
The AI helps. You stay in charge.
